<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Germany APS 70% Pathway Kit</title>
    <style>
        :root {
            --bg-color: #0d1117;
            --card-bg: rgba(22, 27, 34, 0.8);
            --accent-green: #00ff66;
            --accent-glow: rgba(0, 255, 102, 0.2);
            --text-main: #f0f6fc;
            --text-muted: #8b949e;
            --border-color: rgba(240, 246, 252, 0.1);
        }

        * {
            box-sizing: border-box;
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;
            -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;
        }

        body {
            background-color: var(--bg-color);
            color: var(--text-main);
            padding: 20px;
            display: flex;
            justify-content: center;
            align-items: center;
            min-height: 100vh;
        }

        .container {
            width: 100%;
            max-width: 480px;
            background: linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(22, 27, 34, 0.5) 0%, rgba(13, 17, 23, 1) 100%);
            border: 1px solid var(--border-color);
            border-radius: 24px;
            padding: 24px;
            box-shadow: 0 20px 40px rgba(0,0,0,0.5);
            animation: fadeIn 0.6s ease-out;
        }

        header {
            text-align: center;
            margin-bottom: 28px;
        }

        .badge {
            background: rgba(255, 51, 51, 0.1);
            color: #ff3333;
            border: 1px solid rgba(255, 51, 51, 0.2);
            padding: 6px 12px;
            border-radius: 20px;
            font-size: 12px;
            font-weight: 600;
            letter-spacing: 0.5px;
            display: inline-block;
            margin-bottom: 12px;
            animation: pulse 2s infinite;
        }

        h1 {
            font-size: 24px;
            font-weight: 800;
            letter-spacing: -0.5px;
            margin-bottom: 8px;
        }

        h1 span {
            color: var(--accent-green);
            text-shadow: 0 0 10px var(--accent-glow);
        }

        .subtitle {
            font-size: 14px;
            color: var(--text-muted);
            line-height: 1.5;
        }

        .section-title {
            font-size: 14px;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            letter-spacing: 1px;
            color: var(--text-muted);
            margin: 24px 0 12px 4px;
            font-weight: 700;
        }

        .card {
            background: var(--card-bg);
            border: 1px solid var(--border-color);
            border-radius: 16px;
            padding: 16px;
            margin-bottom: 12px;
            transition: all 0.3s cubic-bezier(0.4, 0, 0.2, 1);
            cursor: pointer;
        }

        .card:active {
            transform: scale(0.98);
            border-color: var(--accent-green);
        }

        .card-header {
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            align-items: center;
        }

        .card-title {
            font-size: 16px;
            font-weight: 600;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 10px;
        }

        .icon {
            font-size: 18px;
        }

        .arrow {
            border: solid var(--text-muted);
            border-width: 0 2px 2px 0;
            display: inline-block;
            padding: 3px;
            transform: rotate(45deg);
            transition: transform 0.3s;
        }

        .card.active .arrow {
            transform: rotate(-135deg);
            border-color: var(--accent-green);
        }

        .card-content {
            max-height: 0;
            overflow: hidden;
            transition: max-height 0.3s cubic-bezier(0.4, 0, 0.2, 1);
            color: var(--text-muted);
            font-size: 14px;
            line-height: 1.6;
        }

        .card.active .card-content {
            margin-top: 12px;
            padding-top: 12px;
            border-top: 1px solid rgba(240, 246, 252, 0.05);
        }

        .card-content ul {
            list-style-position: inside;
            margin-top: 8px;
        }

        .card-content li {
            margin-bottom: 6px;
        }

        .highlight-text {
            color: var(--text-main);
            font-weight: 500;
        }

        .copy-box {
            background: #070a0e;
            border: 1px dashed rgba(0, 255, 102, 0.3);
            border-radius: 12px;
            padding: 12px;
            margin-top: 10px;
            position: relative;
            font-family: monospace;
            font-size: 12px;
            color: #a3b3c6;
            word-break: break-word;
        }

        .copy-btn {
            background: var(--accent-green);
            color: #000;
            border: none;
            padding: 6px 12px;
            border-radius: 8px;
            font-size: 11px;
            font-weight: 700;
            cursor: pointer;
            float: right;
            margin-top: -36px;
            margin-right: 4px;
            position: relative;
            z-index: 10;
            transition: background 0.2s;
        }

        .copy-btn:active {
            background: #00cc52;
        }

        .action-btn {
            display: flex;
            justify-content: center;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 8px;
            width: 100%;
            background: linear-gradient(90deg, #00ff66 0%, #00cc52 100%);
            color: #000;
            border: none;
            padding: 16px;
            border-radius: 14px;
            font-size: 16px;
            font-weight: 700;
            text-decoration: none;
            margin-top: 24px;
            box-shadow: 0 4px 15px var(--accent-glow);
            transition: transform 0.2s;
        }

        .action-btn:active {
            transform: scale(0.97);
        }

        @keyframes fadeIn {
            from { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(20px); }
            to { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0); }
        }

        @keyframes pulse {
            0% { box-shadow: 0 0 0 0 rgba(255, 51, 51, 0.4); }
            70% { box-shadow: 0 0 0 8px rgba(255, 51, 51, 0); }
            100% { box-shadow: 0 0 0 0 rgba(255, 51, 51, 0); }
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

<div class="container">
    <header>
        <div class="badge">ANABIN DATABASE UPDATE 🚨</div>
        <h1>APS <span>70% Rule</span> Kit</h1>
        <p class="subtitle">Official strategic pathways for Indian students with under 70% in Class XII boards.</p>
    </header>

    <div class="section-title">The Strategic Options</div>

    <!-- Card 1 -->
    <div class="card" onclick="toggleCard(this)">
        <div class="card-header">
            <div class="card-title"><span class="icon">🏫</span> Pathway 1: Studienkolleg</div>
            <div class="arrow"></div>
        </div>
        <div class="card-content">
            If your Class XII score is beneath 70%, your direct path is gated, but you can enter via the <span class="highlight-text">Foundation Course (Studienkolleg)</span>. 
            <ul>
                <li>Requires clearing the <span class="highlight-text">Aufnahmeprüfung</span> entrance test.</li>
                <li>Demands a strong command of the German language (typically level B2).</li>
                <li>Leads directly to public university placement upon passing the Feststellungsprüfung (FSP).</li>
            </ul>
        </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Card 2 -->
    <div class="card" onclick="toggleCard(this)">
        <div class="card-header">
            <div class="card-title"><span class="icon">🎓</span> Pathway 2: Private Universities</div>
            <div class="arrow"></div>
        </div>
        <div class="card-content">
            Many state-recognized private institutions operate on holistic evaluation parameters rather than rigid database cutoff marks.
            <ul>
                <li>Often permit entry with <span class="highlight-text">English-taught foundation pathways</span>.</li>
                <li>Bypasses public structural board blockers seamlessly.</li>
                <li>Ensure the institution is officially accredited by the German Council of Science and Humanities.</li>
            </ul>
        </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Card 3 -->
    <div class="card" onclick="toggleCard(this)">
        <div class="card-header">
            <div class="card-title"><span class="icon">📋</span> Official Verification Copy</div>
            <div class="arrow"></div>
        </div>
        <div class="card-content" onclick="event.stopPropagation();">
            Copy this official email layout to query your target university's international office directly regarding alternative options:
            <div class="copy-box" id="emailTemplate">
                Sehr geehrte Damen und Herren, ich plane ein Bachelorstudium in Deutschland. Mein indischer Sekundarschulabschluss liegt unter 70%. Bieten Sie ein internes Studienkolleg oder ein Vorbereitungssemester an? Vielen Dank.
            </div>
            <button class="copy-btn" onclick="copyText()">COPY CODE</button>
        </div>
    </div>

    <a href="https://kmk.org" target="_blank" class="action-btn">
        Open Official Anabin Portal 🌐
    </a>
</div>

<script>
